sequenceDiagram
  %% 02a Agent use: one grounded question, browser -> app -> Supervisor -> RAG / Genie / tools
  autonumber
  actor U as User (browser)
  participant A as st-jude-mygpt<br/>Databricks App
  participant L as projects/mygpt<br/>Lakebase (databricks_postgres.mygpt)
  participant S as mygpt-supervisor<br/>agent endpoint
  participant C as mygpt-chat<br/>AI Gateway (router LLM)
  participant R as mygpt-rag-agent<br/>agent endpoint
  participant G as Genie space 01f1c8e7…<br/>"MyGPT structured data"
  participant T as mygpt_tools<br/>UC functions (managed MCP)
  participant X as RCSB / NCBI<br/>public APIs
  participant M as /Shared/mygpt/mygpt-rag-agent<br/>MLflow experiment 2750091371639406

  U->>A: POST /api/ask {question, libraries, model} (OBO token)
  A->>L: resolveLibraries: RLS as the user (mygpt.user / mygpt.groups)
  opt upload libraries selected
    A->>A: hybrid search over upload_chunks (see diagram 04)
  end
  A->>S: POST /serving-endpoints/mygpt-supervisor/invocations<br/>custom_inputs {libraries[+sources], route, history}
  loop up to 4 steps (MAX_STEPS)
    S->>C: chat + tool definitions (tool_choice auto / required)
    C-->>S: tool call(s)
    alt search_documents (≤ 4 libraries in parallel)
      S->>R: POST /serving-endpoints/mygpt-rag-agent/invocations<br/>custom_inputs {corpus, sources?, k, model}
      R-->>S: answer, sources, qrs / ars / hi_eq / hi_rf, trace_id
    else query_structured_data
      S->>G: MCP tools/call query_space → poll_response (≤ 90 s)
      G-->>S: SQL result over kinome / kinase_papers / corpus_documents (≤ 50 rows)
    else domain tools (pubmed_summary, search_pdb_by_gene, …)
      S->>T: POST /api/2.0/mcp/functions/structural_biology/mygpt_tools (tools/call)
      T->>X: HTTP via rcsb_search / rcsb_data / ncbi_eutils connections
      X-->>T: JSON
      T-->>S: tool result
    end
  end
  opt several libraries or multi-turn
    S->>C: merge turn (renumber citations)
  end
  S-->>A: answer + custom_outputs {route, sources, scores, trace_id, tool_calls}
  A->>L: saveTurn → conversations, questions, answers, sources
  A-->>U: answer with citations and trust scores
  S--)M: traces (supervisor + RAG spans, async)
  U->>A: 👍 / 👎 on an answer
  A->>L: feedback row
  A->>M: POST /api/3.0/mlflow/traces/{trace_id}/assessments (user_rating)
